Conflicts: touch-keyboard
Replaces: touch-keyboard
Description: Lenovo Yoga Book Halo keyboard and pen input integration
 Translates the Goodix touch surface in the Lenovo Yoga Book keyboard half into
 virtual keyboard and internal touchpad devices, with optional DRV2604 haptic
 feedback.
 .
 The package also installs narrowly matched udev and hardware-database entries,
 including the YB1-X91L Wacom pen orientation calibration.
